    "narrative": "The Austin Waves enter today\u2019s slate with **Gunnar Henderson** and **Jackson Merrill** serving as our primary offensive catalysts. **Gunnar Henderson** (70.72) faces a tough assignment in Gausman, but his elite lineup position and the fact that Gausman\u2019s delivery offers a prime environment for base-stealing potential\u2014a critical factor given our emphasis on the scarcity of SBs\u2014keep him as our highest-scoring start. Similarly, **Jackson Merrill** (67.41) benefits from a favorable platoon advantage against Brazob\u00e1n, and while the opposing catcher\u2019s pop time and the pitcher's hold rate offer marginal resistance, the combined boost from his batting order and favorable wind conditions makes him a high-efficiency play. **Kyle Tucker** (66.88) and **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (64.55) round out our tier-one options, both providing high-floor production despite moderate SP_xERA figures from their respective matchups.\n\nOur most difficult roster decision today involved the bottom of the order, where **Miguel Vargas** (48.58) narrowly edged out **Nolan Schanuel** (41.09) for the final UTIL slot. While **Miguel Vargas** faces a stiff test against Nola, his elevated batting order position provides enough volume to keep his efficiency score above our 40.0 \"marginal\" threshold. In contrast, **Nolan Schanuel** fell short due to a unfavorable matchup against Sheehan, which depressed his SP_xERA-adjusted projection enough to justify the benching. We continue to monitor the status of **Andy Pages**, who remains unavailable, while the rest of our bench\u2014including **Dominic Smith** and **Brayan Rocchio**\u2014remains below our required efficiency floor due to poor SP matchups or unfavorable batting order placement. **Liam Hicks** (44.71) and **Miguel Andujar** (43.78) are active starts today, but they carry the lowest confidence scores in our lineup; **Miguel Andujar** specifically requires caution, as his platoon disadvantage against Brazob\u00e1n is only partially offset by helpful wind conditions.",
